<title>USA: Omaha cattle $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers $1.00 higher, some sales strong at the advance. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to largely Choice 2-4 1000-1300 lbs 65.00-66.50. Select 63.00-65.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 950-1200 lbs 64.50-66.00, few loads or part loads 66.50. Select 62.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
